  "purpose": "HBM-PVM-SAFE 10-19 structural SAFE redesign of smh_pvm (ot_hbm_sm_pv_merge, attn leaf band of rp4a) after route smh_pvm_ref_r4-r3-f63e66b4c NEEDS_RTL TT -125.42 / FF -17.57 / DRC 0. Classified (TT): macro rd_out -> operand mux -> adder A1 decode/compare u_ca -125 (456 paths, 14 lv); fd1 -> 3-way write mux -> macro wd_in -49 (18 lv); ev pin reg -> operand mux -> u_ca -21 (21 lv). FF hold: adder pass-through stages (u_cb->u_cd, s2->u_cc) -17.6 with 40 ps leaf skew, fw_a delay line. Fixes: SAFE 1 = operand registers before the 16 adders (result register vreg dropped: merge turn stays 8 cycles, cycle-identical), adders DRST 0 (no datapath reset: ~7k reset loads gone), write data ev ? sum : y (2:1, one registered select), fold tracker 8-slot ring (no fw_a/fw_v delay line). Floorplan: outline 259.2 x 172.8 (1.5:1, was 373.68 x 146.88 = 2.54:1) from synthesis area, SRAM on the 43.2 lattice at (43.2, 43.2) with 43.2 / 44.7 um channels on its W / E pin faces, full-width std-cell bands N and S. Schedule: fold write-back +1 cycle (pub of node 0 F0+22 -> F0+23 in the Qwen h128 calendar), handed to TW5-HBM-DIE / HBM-REPRICE3.",
